Options:
(A) $1.00$$10^{10} \text { electrons; }$
(B) $4.00$$10^{10} \text { electrons; }$
(C) $3.00$$10^{10} \text { electrons; }$
(D) $8.00 \times 10^{10}$ electrons;
(E) $5.00 \times 10^{10}$ electrons;
(F) $1.50 \times 10^{10}$ electrons;
(G) $7.50 \times 10^{9}$ electrons;
(H) $2.00$$10^{10} \text { electrons; }$
(I) $6.00 \times 10^{10}$ electrons;
(J) $9.00 \times 10^{9}$ electrons;

End your response with a final line of the form "Answer: X". X is the letter of the correct option.
